#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example demonstrates the effectiveness of the jounce and rebound stops while the vehicle travels over a synthesized chassis twist road.
#
#The jounce and rebound stops are part of the suspension compliance properties, and depending on your vehicle data may be defined on their own screens, seperately from spring data. Browse to the suspension compliance datasets on the Vehicle: Assembly screen for more information.
